  "notes": "All concession stands operate on a cashless basis. The arena has 3 food courts on each of the two general seating levels (Plaza and Upper). Club Level has 3 food courts + 2 kiosks. New food and beverage locations were added for the 2025-26 season including several new bars on the Upper Level. The arena is fully equipped with accessible seating, elevators, ramps, and accessible parking. Family restrooms are available on all levels. The arena was formerly known as FLA Live Arena, BB&T Center, BankAtlantic Center, Office Depot Center, and National Car Rental Center."
